      "after": 8,
      "effort": "a weekend",
      "kind": "tooling",
      "blurb": "The naive VM-to-assembly translation is wildly redundant. Add constant folding and a peephole pass, then measure cycles saved on a real program. Optimisation with a number attached to it.",
      "status": "idea"
